":"java-inheritance-constructor","sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/java/java-inheritance.html","sourceSha256":"a07de54eb63e8b478d873dca60d0df053e8566bec280ab6651e4f96dcdcb37a2","questionId":null,"articleSourceOrder":27,"status":"authored","platformRef":{"id":"java.lesson.5741b053a94b56c5d115","version":"1.0.0"},"goal":"按父类到子类观察初始化。","body":["子类创建包含父类的初始化阶段。需要参数的父构造器应被明确调用；缺少可访问无参构造时不能依赖隐式调用。"],"reason":"依原目录原创改写并保留出处。","leaf":true,"exampleId":"java.example.5741b053a94b56c5d115","activityId":"java.check.5741b053a94b56c5d115"},{"sourceNodeId":"java-source/java-inheritance#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~2","parent":"java-source/java-inheritance","order":22,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Java 继承","实例"],"titleOccurrence":2,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/java/java-inheritance.html","sourceSha256":"a07de54eb63e8b478d873dca60d0df053e8566bec280ab6651e4f96dcdcb37a2","questionId":null,"articleSourceOrder":27,"status":"context-only","platformRef":{"id":"java.source.1fa1c52fa8a308c26087","version":"1.0.0"},"reason":"原例子标题与父子位置。"}],"examples":[{"id":"java.example.216242f72b2cdc9bf0fb","lessonId":"java.lesson.216242f72b2cdc9bf0fb","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"司机持有车钥匙，是否应让 Driver 继承 Vehicle？","result":"不应。司机使用车辆，但司机对象不能替代车辆对象。"},{"id":"java.example.73d49cd4fe167f72e883","lessonId":"java.lesson.73d49cd4fe167f72e883","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"若两者都有一个非静态 drive 方法，调用覆盖关系前先核对什么？","result":"核对签名与可见性是否满足覆盖，并判断接收者的实际类。"},{"id":"java.example.4e674a1f44205d041142","lessonId":"java.lesson.4e674a1f44205d041142","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"卡车与公交车都能启动，父类型 Vehicle 可以规定什么？","result":"规定 start 的可依赖行为；需要不同实现时由各子类型按约定提供。"},{"id":"java.example.b01b406cc92f1ca35cb8","lessonId":"java.lesson.b01b406cc92f1ca35cb8","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"class A extends B,C 能表达两个父类吗？","result":"不能。可选择单一父类，用接口或组合表达其他能力。"},{"id":